  "description": {
   "en": "Cheok Ryugeom, a Goryeo swordsman, threw himself off a cliff holding the enemy for his master's sake.\n\nHowever, he wakes up in the modern era—900 years later—after being frostbound...\n\nThis is the revenge tale of Goryeo's top swordsman in the modern era.",
   "id": "Cheok Ryugeom, seorang pendekar pedang dari Goryeo, mengorbankan dirinya dengan melompat dari tebing sambil menahan musuh demi tuannya.\n\nNamun, ketika ia membuka mata, ia mendapati dirinya berada di era modern—900 tahun kemudian—setelah terperangkap dalam es…\n\nInilah kisah balas dendam pendekar pedang terkuat Goryeo di dunia modern!",
   "ko": "주인을 위해 적을 안고 절벽에 떨어진 고려무사 척류검.\n\n빙하 속에 900년 동안 얼어있다 현대시대에 깨어나는데...\n\n현대시대에 깨어난 고려제일검의 복수극."
  },
